sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (web)
    participant A as API
    participant N as Neo4j
    participant M as Meilisearch
    participant L as LLM (chat port)
    participant PG as Postgres

    U->>A: POST /chat — "What did we decide about X?"
    A->>A: classify question → traversal template
    A->>N: parameterized Cypher (deterministic)
    A->>M: hybrid full-text + vector query
    N-->>A: graph moments
    M-->>A: ranked moments
    A->>L: synthesize answer over retrieved moments
    L-->>A: draft with [[moment:uuid]] markers
    A->>PG: citation validator resolves EVERY marker
    alt all markers resolve
        A-->>U: streamed answer + citations → video replay at startMs
    else any claim uncited
        A-->>U: rejected — no citation, no answer
    end
